{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type QueriesOptions<T, TResults, TDepth> = TDepth[\"length\"] extends MAXIMUM_DEPTH ? QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries[] : T extends [] ? [] : T extends [infer Head] ? [...TResults, GetCreateQueryOptionsForCreateQueries<Head>] : T extends [infer Head, ...(infer Tails)] ? QueriesOptions<[...Tails], [...TResults, GetCreateQueryOptionsForCreateQueries<Head>], [...TDepth, 1]> : ReadonlyArray<unknown> extends T ? T : T extends QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries<infer TQueryFnData, infer TError, infer TData, infer TQueryKey>[] ? QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>[] : QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-queries.ts#L153","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-queries.ts:153"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queries"},{"type":"text","value":" array accepted by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectQueries"},{"type":"text","value":". Recursively unwraps each tuple element so every entry's\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"throwOnError"},{"type":"text","value":" are inferred individually, up to 20 elements — past that, tuple\nrecursion falls back to a single homogeneous options type. An opaque array (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown[]"},{"type":"text","value":") is returned\nas-is; a non-tuple array of a known element type is mapped to that element type instead, with no such\nlimit."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queries"},{"type":"text","value":" array as written at the call site."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tresults","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TResults"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TResults"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":"[] = []"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The internal accumulator that this type builds during recursion. It is not meant to\nbe set explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdepth","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TDepth"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TDepth"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReadonlyArray"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":"> = []"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The internal recursion-depth counter, checked against the 20-element limit. It is not\nmeant to be set explicitly."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"tresults","text":"TResults","level":3},{"id":"tdepth","text":"TDepth","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype QueriesOptions<T, TResults, TDepth> = TDepth[\"length\"] extends MAXIMUM_DEPTH ? QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries[] : T extends [] ? [] : T extends [infer Head] ? [...TResults, GetCreateQueryOptionsForCreateQueries<Head>] : T extends [infer Head, ...(infer Tails)] ? QueriesOptions<[...Tails], [...TResults, GetCreateQueryOptionsForCreateQueries<Head>], [...TDepth, 1]> : ReadonlyArray<unknown> extends T ? T : T extends QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries<infer TQueryFnData, infer TError, infer TData, infer TQueryKey>[] ? QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>[] : QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-queries.ts:153](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-queries.ts#L153)\n\nThe `queries` array accepted by `injectQueries`. Recursively unwraps each tuple element so every entry's\n`queryFn`/`select`/`throwOnError` are inferred individually, up to 20 elements — past that, tuple\nrecursion falls back to a single homogeneous options type. An opaque array (e.g. `unknown[]`) is returned\nas-is; a non-tuple array of a known element type is mapped to that element type instead, with no such\nlimit.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* `any`[]\n\nThe type of the `queries` array as written at the call site.\n\n### TResults\n\n`TResults` *extends* `any`[] = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal accumulator that this type builds during recursion. It is not meant to\nbe set explicitly.\n\n### TDepth\n\n`TDepth` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<`number`\\> = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal recursion-depth counter, checked against the 20-element limit. It is not\nmeant to be set explicitly.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueriesOptions\ntitle: QueriesOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype QueriesOptions<T, TResults, TDepth> = TDepth[\"length\"] extends MAXIMUM_DEPTH ? QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries[] : T extends [] ? [] : T extends [infer Head] ? [...TResults, GetCreateQueryOptionsForCreateQueries<Head>] : T extends [infer Head, ...(infer Tails)] ? QueriesOptions<[...Tails], [...TResults, GetCreateQueryOptionsForCreateQueries<Head>], [...TDepth, 1]> : ReadonlyArray<unknown> extends T ? T : T extends QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries<infer TQueryFnData, infer TError, infer TData, infer TQueryKey>[] ? QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>[] : QueryObserverOptionsForCreateQueries[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-queries.ts:153](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-queries.ts#L153)\n\nThe `queries` array accepted by `injectQueries`. Recursively unwraps each tuple element so every entry's\n`queryFn`/`select`/`throwOnError` are inferred individually, up to 20 elements — past that, tuple\nrecursion falls back to a single homogeneous options type. An opaque array (e.g. `unknown[]`) is returned\nas-is; a non-tuple array of a known element type is mapped to that element type instead, with no such\nlimit.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* `any`[]\n\nThe type of the `queries` array as written at the call site.\n\n### TResults\n\n`TResults` *extends* `any`[] = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal accumulator that this type builds during recursion. It is not meant to\nbe set explicitly.\n\n### TDepth\n\n`TDepth` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<`number`\\> = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal recursion-depth counter, checked against the 20-element limit. It is not\nmeant to be set explicitly.\n"}
